@startuml Spring Courier - Visão Geral da Arquitetura
!theme plain
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam backgroundColor white

' handwritten era antigo — agora basta não usar.
' Se quiser deixar explícito a versão nova:
!option handwritten false
title Spring Courier - Visão Geral Simplificada

skinparam rectangle {
    BackgroundColor<<client>> LightBlue
    BackgroundColor<<controller>> LightGreen
    BackgroundColor<<courier>> Gold
    BackgroundColor<<pipeline>> Orange
    BackgroundColor<<handler>> LightCoral
    BackgroundColor<<storage>> LightGray
}

rectangle "Cliente\n(HTTP Request)" as Client <<client>>
rectangle "REST Controller\n@RestController" as Controller <<controller>>

rectangle "Spring Courier Library" {
    rectangle "Courier\n(Mediator)" as Courier <<courier>>
    
    rectangle "Pipeline\n(Behaviors)" as Pipeline <<pipeline>> {
        rectangle "Validation" as Val
        rectangle "Logging" as Log
        rectangle "Transaction" as Tx
    }
    
    rectangle "Handler Registry" as Registry
}

rectangle "Domain Layer" {
    rectangle "Command Handler\n@Service" as CmdHandler <<handler>>
    rectangle "Query Handler\n@Service" as QryHandler <<handler>>
    rectangle "Notification Handler\n@Service" as NotHandler <<handler>>
}

rectangle "Data Storage\n(Database)" as DB <<storage>>

' Flow
Client -down-> Controller : "1. HTTP POST"
Controller -down-> Courier : "2. send(command)"
Courier -right-> Pipeline : "3. execute pipeline"
Pipeline -down-> Registry : "4. get handler"
Registry -down-> CmdHandler : "5. invoke"
CmdHandler -right-> DB : "6. persist"
DB -up-> CmdHandler : "7. result"
CmdHandler -up-> Registry : "8. response"
Registry -up-> Pipeline : "9. response"
Pipeline -up-> Courier : "10. response"
Courier -up-> Controller : "11. Response<T>"
Controller -up-> Client : "12. HTTP 200 OK"

note right of Courier
  **Ponto Central**
  • Despacha Commands
  • Despacha Queries
  • Publica Notifications
end note

note right of Pipeline
  **Comportamentos Transversais**
  • Validação de entrada
  • Logging de operações
  • Gerenciamento de transações
  • Behaviors customizados
end note

note right of CmdHandler
  **Handlers**
  • Implementam lógica de negócio
  • Descobertos automaticamente
  • Registrados no Spring Context
  • Um handler por request type
end note

note bottom of Client
  **CQRS Pattern**
  • Commands: Modificam estado (Write)
  • Queries: Consultam dados (Read)
  • Notifications: Eventos assíncronos
end note

@enduml
